{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "a9d90268-c7fd-8444-a3f3-424c66992a26",
  "created_at": "2025-12-09T10:40:03-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Peter Gardiner",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:36:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:36:34-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Good morning. My name is Peter Gardiner. I am calling about, um, water in the street. Flooding. I have a note, so I will read it, please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:36:44-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, go ahead. Take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:36:47-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. The location is one hundred thirty-seven Coggeshall Avenue, in Historic Hill. After the nor'easter from Friday into Saturday, three days ago, the water is still high. It is over the curb and across the sidewalk. [pause] Yesterday a delivery truck got stuck in it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:37:03-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh no. Stuck how, like it stalled out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:37:07-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, stalled. The driver was standing there, he was calling someone. Then a tow came, I think. It took a long time. [line breaks up] Sorry, you are there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:37:18-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm here. You're on speaker, right? You're a little echoey, but I can hear you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:37:24-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, speakerphone. I am sorry. My phone is, um, on the table because I hold the paper."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:37:31-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all. Is the water going into your property, or is it staying in the street and sidewalk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:37:39-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For now it is the street and the sidewalk. It is close to my steps. I am worried if it rains again it will come to the door. I am also worried for people walking, because they must go in the road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:37:54-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That makes sense. Do you know if the drain on your corner is clogged, or is it just that the water has nowhere to go?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:38:03-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do not know exactly. The grate has leaves, I think, and some trash. But I did not touch it. [pause] Also I must say, before, I called about this street. A person told me it is a state road. So the city does not do it. I did not understand what to do then."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:38:22-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's helpful to know. Sometimes that's true for certain roads, and the state handles the drains on them. Let me look at how this one is listed, and I'll put in a report to our crew either way so somebody checks it and sorts out who owns it. Can you hold for a moment?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:38:41-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I can hold. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:38:44-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks for waiting. I've got the report started. I've got one thirty-seven Coggeshall Avenue, water over the curb and onto the sidewalk since the storm, truck stalled in it yesterday, possible debris on the grate. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:38:58-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is right. Exactly. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:39:01-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And what's a good number to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:39:05-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is four zero one, five five five, zero one six zero. But, um, maybe I do not answer fast. My cousin is borrowing my car, and I am waiting for him to bring it back. I am home, but I may be outside to meet him."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:39:22-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, we'll leave a message if we miss you. I can't promise a time for the crew, they're backed up after the storm, but I'll note that you want a call back when it's been looked at."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:39:36-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. A call back when it is done. That is what I want. So I know if it is the city or the state."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:39:45-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. I'll write that in. In the meantime, stay off the flooded part of the street and keep people away from the edge of it, especially kids."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:39:55-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I will do. Thank you very much for your help, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:40:00-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Gardiner. Take care."
    }
  ],
